hing Films Inc. After it declared bankruptcy, he opened his own company, Key Productions, but found film distributors uninterested in his ideas to create animated films of children's picture books.", "biography_author": "Wikidata", "date_of_biography": "2023-08-01T16:21:02.181213+10:00", "external_links": [{"id": 4755, "uri": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morton_Schindel"}], "uuid": "31dad539-f59e-42b1-b147-540fc9ac7fc7", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "25539", "external_references": [{"id": 25710, "source": {"name": "Wikidata", "slug": "wikidata"}, "source_identifier": "Q6914942"}, {"id": 30468, "source": {"name": "VIAF", "slug": "viaf"}, "source_identifier": "70251582"}, {"id": 30469, "source": {"name": "LOC Auth", "slug": "loc-auth"}, "source_identifier": "n81074386"}, {"id": 30470, "source": {"name": "WorldCat", "slug": "worldcat"}, "source_identifier": "lccn-n81074386"}], "date_modified": "2023-09-05T23:21:50.102238+10:00"}, {"id": 13574, "name": "Shirley Cobham", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2403467, "title": "Castles and country: a view of Scotland", "work_id": 65853, "role": "director", "role_id": 938, "is_primary": true}], "also_known_as": "", "date_of_birth": "", "date_of_death": "", "genders": [], "languages": [], "places_of_operation": [], "biography": "", "biography_author": null, "date_of_biography": "2023-08-11T15:13:11.058066+10:00", "external_links": [], "uuid": "49946c0e-43ce-4648-a19c-6ba188068a18", "source": {"name": "Vernon", "slug": "vernon"}, "source_identifier": "28773", "external_references": [], "date_modified": "2023-08-11T15:13:11.058391+10:00"}, {"id": 13573, "name": "National Benzole", "roles_in_work": [{"id": 2403466, "title": "Castles and country: a view of Scotland", "work_id": 65853, "role": "production company", "role_id": 941, "is_primary": true}, {"id": 854605, "title": "Our national heritage: the living pattern", "work_id": 69811, "role": "production company", "role_id": 941, "is_primary": true